OL,3,GNEWSAFlagship ferry Manxman's return
OL,4,Afurther delayed
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe return of the Isle of Man's
OL,7,Fflagship ferry has been further delayed
OL,8,Fas repairs continue, its operator has
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,11,FThe Manxman has been out of service
OL,12,Fsince July due to worn shaft bearings
OL,13,Fand associated shaft liners that
OL,14,Fprotect the vessel's main propulsion
OL,15,Fshafts.
OL,17,FBack-up passenger vessel the
OL,18,FBen-my-Chree is now expected to
OL,19,Fcontinue carrying out sailings between
OL,20,Fthe island and Lancashire until 11
OL,21,FDecember.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
FL,449,445,260,140,0,100
