OL,3,GNEWSAFlagship ferry Manxman's return
OL,4,Afurther delayed
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Isle of Man Steam Packet Company
OL,7,Fsaid the latest hold-up was due to the
OL,8,Fneed for new tapered locking wedges to
OL,9,Fbe made following the installation of
OL,10,Fthe vessel's new bearings last week.
